 "deviations": [
  "the only settings that move are --vram-reserve-mib and --vram-reserve-later-mib; a dry-run refuses the run if any other field differs once the harness paths are blanked.",
  "all three arms symlink the SAME engine, helper and serving wrapper; no binary, build or precision differs, so nothing here is a quality claim \u2014 the unchanged binary and the matched sampling settings prove no intentional quality reduction, nothing more.",
  "conversation-cache-dir is retargeted to a per-arm empty directory: every arm boots cold and the production cache inventory is never mutated. Identical treatment for all arms.",
  "requests pin production's sampling and reasoning effort through the frozen request template, not the driver's temperature-0 parity defaults; enable_thinking and anything else unlisted is left to the current server. Hashes are recorded, completions are not compared.",
  "one stack at a time on 127.0.0.1:8009, the launcher's own port: production must be down before --run and comes back through the restore step, never as a second stack.",
  "the boot log, engine log, sockets and driver records are per-arm, so no gate can read a stale shared log and no arm can write another arm's evidence."
 ],
